---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Pritom Mandol | Gameplay & AI Programmer</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN for instant styling in browser -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans">

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
      
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <header class="mb-16 border-b border-slate-800 pb-10">
        <div class="inline-block bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 border border-cyan-800">
          Primary Engine: Unreal Engine 5.7
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">
          Pritom Mandol
        </h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-6">
          Gameplay & AI Programmer
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Specialising in autonomous decision-making systems, State Trees, Environment Query System (EQS) spatial queries, and decoupled Blueprint architecture in Unreal Engine 5.7.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-medium">
          <a href="#case-study" class="bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            View EcoLab Case Study
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" class="border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
            GitHub Profile
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Case Study Section -->
      <section id="case-study" class="mb-20">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Featured Technical Capstone</span>
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-1">EcoLab: Natural Selection Sandbox</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 text-sm font-mono text-slate-400">
            Role: Solo Programmer | Engine: UE5.7 (Blueprints, State Trees, EQS)
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Video/Demo Container -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-12 aspect-video flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 font-mono">
          <p>[ 16:9 Gameplay Debug Video Embed: Perception Cones & Telemetry HUD ]</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Process Artifacts Grid -->
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-200">System Architecture & Process Artifacts</h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
          
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">01 / DATA SCHEMA</span>
            <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-1 mb-2">Genome Schema & Blueprint Architecture</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Designed a modular <code class="text-cyan-300 bg-slate-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">FGenomeData</code> struct housing movement speed, mesh scale, metabolism decay, and vision radius. On BeginPlay, creatures parse DNA to scale meshes and movement attributes without direct class casting.
            </p>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Key Tech: User Defined Structs, Decoupled Architecture</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">02 / AI DECISION ENGINE</span>
            <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-1 mb-2">State Trees & EQS Perception Engine</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Constructed an autonomous decision-making engine using UE5.7 State Trees (Wandering, Seeking Food, Seeking Mate). Integrated Environment Query System (EQS) to perform real-time spatial scoring for resource nodes inside dynamic vision cones.
            </p>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Key Tech: UE5 State Trees, EQS Spatial Scoring</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">03 / GENETICS LIBRARY</span>
            <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-1 mb-2">Genetic Mutation & Inheritance Engine</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Authored a Blueprint Function Library (<code class="text-cyan-300 bg-slate-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">BPL_GeneticEngine</code>) that blends parent genome structs and applies a configurable mutation rate (±5%) to pass evolved traits to child generations upon successful mating.
            </p>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Key Tech: Evolutionary Math, Blueprint Function Library</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">04 / ANALYTICS & UI</span>
            <h5 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-1 mb-2">Real-Time Telemetry & Simulation HUD</h5>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Developed an in-game telemetry dashboard recording live population counts, active generation numbers, and real-time trend graphs tracking average speed, size, and vision radius shifts under environmental starvation pressure.
            </p>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Key Tech: UMG Dashboard, Simulation Profiling</div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Skills Matrix -->
      <section class="mb-20 border-t border-slate-800 pt-12">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Core Technical Competencies</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm mb-3">AI & Systems</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li>• UE5 State Trees Framework</li>
              <li>• Environment Query System (EQS)</li>
              <li>• Genetic Mutation Algorithms</li>
              <li>• Gameplay Tags & Interfaces</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm mb-3">Engine & Scripting</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li>• Unreal Engine 5.7</li>
              <li>• Blueprint Visual Scripting</li>
              <li>• C++ Fundamentals</li>
              <li>• UMG Telemetry UI</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm mb-3">Development Practices</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li>• Technical Design Documentation (TDD)</li>
              <li>• Performance Profiling (`stat unit`)</li>
              <li>• Git Version Control</li>
              <li>• Process Artifact Curation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer / Contact -->
      <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-sm text-slate-500">
        <div>© 2026 Pritom Mandol. Built with Astro & Tailwind CSS.</div>
        <div class="flex gap-6 mt-4 md:mt-0">
          <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Email</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </footer>

    </main>

  </body>
</html>